  "description": "Yun Ha-Jun, who struggled to pursue his musical career despite his iffy talents and ended up sacrificing his own family along the way.\n\n\"If only I could turn back time...! \"\n\nOne day, after living with regrets and alcohol for a while, he woke up and found himself had returned to the past. Just then, it dawned on him.\n\n*The fact that my younger sister is a musical genius...! Now is the time to turn my life around, by producing my younger sister into becoming the best singer!* \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
